\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar/mark on firm footing with eye on Russia. \b0\par\par\uc2 574 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 August 1998\par 13:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LONDON, Aug 18 (Reuters) - The dollar was steady near its session high against the mark at Europe's midsession although traders were very vigilant about any developments in Russia, either economic or political. \par \par \uc2  Against the yen, the dollar was struggling near its session low but had calmed down after being driven down by Japanese Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa's comment that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  was ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  at any time. \par \par \uc2  Dollar/mark was quoted at 1.7994/97 at 1040 GMT after poking above 1.80 earlier, while dollar/yen was quoted at 145.67/72, off a session low of 145.35. \par \par \uc2  While traders said they were keeping an eye on the Russian markets after the effective devaluation of the rouble on Monday, they were also wary about possible dismissals and resignations by top Russian officials. \par \par \uc2  President Boris Yeltsin dismissed his top economic advisor Alexander Livshits, while Interfax news agency said Yeltsin rejected resignation offers from Prime Minister Kiriyenko and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Dubinin. \par \par \uc2  "But the Russia issue is starting to be factored into the market," said one trader at a French bank in London. \par \par \uc2  "Dollar/mark ran up yesterday and wasn't able to hold out. People sitting on long positions in dollar/mark in anticipation of things going wrong in Russia are probably going to be priced out of the market," the trader said. \par \par \uc2  But analysts said the markets could not yet afford to be complacent about the Russian financial crisis. \par \par \uc2  "It's not necessarily over yet. We'll get a lot of details about what they're going to do next and also about who's going to be left in the government at the end of it," said Francis Breedon, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at Lehman Brothers in London. \par \par \uc2  But separately from the Russian issue, analysts said there were fundamental economic factors which should put a cap on dollar/mark. \par \par \uc2  "There's the growth cycle, with the U.S. economy clearly slowing down and the European economies gathering pace," said Julian Jessop, chief European economist at Nikko Europe. "And there's the euro story, with a growing number of investors becoming comfortable with the euro and increasing their holdings of European assets." \par \par \uc2  Evidence that Germany suffers less from the Asian crisis than the United States should dampen dollar/mark, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. trade balance reached a record deficit of $15.75 billion in May, and the data for June, due out at 1230 GMT, are forecast to show a slight improvement to $15.4 billion. \par \par \uc2  Data on Tuesday showed the German trade surplus at 11.2 billion marks in June, down from May's 14.2 billion. \par \par \uc2  Dollar/yen, which had been bumped off its high of 146.40 overnight on fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was at 145.68/73 at Europe's midday. Traders said, however, that bullish dollar/yen fundamentals were firmly intact. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is possible but I don't see it happening right now. There's been a good performance by the Nikkei (Tokyo stock average) and that's probably more important," said Breedon. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. Federal Open Market Committee meets for its regular policy-making meeting today, but economists expect the Fed to leave interest rates unchanged when it announces its decision around 1815 GMT. \par \par \uc2  ((Chizu Nomiyama, London newsroom 44 171 542 6721, uk.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 .news@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8i011em\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
