\par\par \b \uc2  Tokyo/Dlr -2: Rumors Of BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 , But Some Doubt It \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 1998\par 02:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--The dollar dropped from an early intraday high of Y147.42 around 2310 GMT (7:10 p.m. EDT) to a low of Y145.61 at 0019 GMT Wednesday morning as U.S. hedge funds placed large dollar selling orders to book profits in a thin holiday market, Tokyo traders said. \par \par \uc2  Comments from Japanese officials, including the head of the international bureau at \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , warning of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  contributed to the dollar's fall, but market participants said actual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unlikely. \par \par \uc2  The dollar quickly bounced off support around Y145.60 to move back to the mid-Y146 level. \par \par \uc2  "What we are concerned about is that the yen is weakening in such a way that it doesn't reflect economic fundamentals, and that is not only undesirable for the Japanese economy, but for other Asian economies as well," Haruhiko Kuroda, head of the international bureau, told a small group reporters. \par \par \uc2  "We will take appropriate action in the market as necessary," he added. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the moves in the market were exaggerated by thin conditions. \par \par \uc2  "The market is extremely thin due to the (week-long "Obon") holiday, and the Kuroda comments encouraged selling by U.S. players," said a Japanese bank trader. \par \par \uc2  "It doesn't look like actual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although there are rumors," added Yuhiko Kaji, vice president of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and treasurys at Sakura Bank. \par \par \uc2  At 0035 GMT, the dollar was trading at Y146.10. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 12-08-98 \par \par \uc2  0039GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8c06t0d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
